# Spriting Ordering or whatever
(note this isnt a spriting GUIDE, that is coming soon!)

so this is how sprites are ordered:

<YourMod>/sprites/
              .../units/any(your directories!)
              .../effect/any(your directiories!)
              ...blocks/
                     ...distribution/
                     ...production/
                     ...walls/
                     ...effect/
                     ...storage/
                     ...liquid/
                     ...power/
                     ...drills/
                     ...turrets/
                     ...units/
                     ...logic/
            
Thats how sprites are structured
(although do correct me if i am wrong!)
